                        <summary xml:lang="">
                            <p>Book of Lights and Watchtowers by Yaʿqūb b. Yiṣḥaq al-Qirqisānī (preserved chapter headings are for discourse III chapters 21-22, discourse IV chapter 63, discourse V chapters 3, 20-21, 31-35, 39-40)</p>
